<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21027" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροντ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thunder</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ζεὺς δ᾽ ἄμυδις βρόντησε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.305
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				8.133
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροντᾶν οὐκ ἐμὸν ἀλλὰ Διός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					490
				</span></i>
			; so <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βροντῶν</span>, title of Zeus
			in Phrygia, <i><span class="en">
				<u>JHS</u>
				5.258
			</span></i>, etc. (but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροντῶν θεός</span>,
				=
			<i>Jupiter Tonans,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				14.982
			</span></i>, cf. 
			<i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				54.4
			</span></i>): metaph. of Pericles, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				531
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>V.</u>
				624
			</span></i>; of a seller asking too high a price, <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				7.65
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> impers.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χειμέρια βροντᾷ</span>
			<i>it thunders</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				46
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βροντήσαντος</span>
			<i>if it thunders</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				610b35
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>to be thunderstruck</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Div.Somn.</u>
				463a13
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
